{"id":"2b83d8c1d5e5d7c5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Filter Limit Set","display":"df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set — ZFC Filter2 Filter Limit Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set — ZFC Filter2 Filter Limit Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-limit]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set — ZFC Filter2 Filter Limit Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68fb21596025bb57\" href=\"?note=68fb21596025bb57\" title=\"58-df-limit\">58-df-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathcal F,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(L,\\mathcal F,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (order-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}limit\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S(L,\\mathcal F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\subseteq)\\land L=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal F)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}limit\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S(L,\\mathcal F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\subseteq)\\land L=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal F)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition now requires an actual filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and a topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limit","status":"resolved","id":"68fb21596025bb57","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}$ (topology predicate, see [[58-df-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$ (order-filter predicate, see [[58-df-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"L,\\mathcal F,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}limit\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterLimitSet}_S(L,\\mathcal F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\subseteq)\\land L=\\{x\\in X\\mid\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal F)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1890","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set.md|58-df-zfc-filter2-filter-limit-set]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1331244a5201bb99","68fb21596025bb57","65d9a1e690c32aad","e7514bc4cefba4f2"]}